          <h2 id="performance">Performance patterns</h2>

          <p>
            <code>build()</code> is the expensive half — 14–662&nbsp;µs depending on shape,
            against sub-microsecond <code>validate()</code> calls. Build at module scope and
            reuse the object; one <code>build()</code> pays for itself after 35–100
            <code>validate()</code> calls on four of the five measured shapes, and after 2
            calls on the 50-element array, where <code>validate()</code> itself costs about
            33&nbsp;µs.
          </p>

